<script setup>import{onMounted,ref}from'vue';import{tempsTravailService}from'@/services/tempsTravailService';const items=ref([]),err=ref('');async function load(){try{items.value=await tempsTravailService.aValider()}catch(e){err.value=e.message}}async function traiter(c,s){try{Object.assign(c,await tempsTravailService.validerCreneau(c.id,s))}catch(e){err.value=e.message}}onMounted(load)</script>
<template><div class="container-fluid py-4"><h1 class="h3">Validation des travaux</h1><p v-if="err" class="alert alert-danger">{{err}}</p><section class="card card-body"><article v-for="c in items" :key="c.id" class="border-bottom py-3 d-flex justify-content-between"><div><strong>{{c.planning?.employe?.prenom}} {{c.planning?.employe?.nom}}</strong><div>{{c.libelle}} · {{c.dateDebut}}</div><span class="badge text-bg-light">{{c.statutEmploye}}</span><div>{{c.commentaireEmploye}}</div></div><div v-if="c.statutValidation==='EN_ATTENTE'"><button class="btn btn-success btn-sm me-2" @click="traiter(c,'VALIDEE')">Accepter</button><button class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" @click="traiter(c,'REFUSEE')">Refuser · à refaire</button></div></article></section></div></template>
